Enhance 15 to 23.

394
00:45:25,556 --> 00:45:27,934
Give me a hard copy right there.

395
00:46:24,699 --> 00:46:26,284
Fish?

396
00:46:41,632 --> 00:46:44,635
I think it was manufactured locally.

397
00:46:49,223 --> 00:46:53,894
Finest quality. Superior workmanship.

398
00:46:54,729 --> 00:46:57,148
There is the maker's serial number.

399
00:46:57,315 --> 00:47:03,821
9906947-XB71.

400
00:47:04,488 --> 00:47:05,823
Interesting.

401
00:47:06,907 --> 00:47:10,828
Not fish. Snake scale.

402
00:47:10,995 --> 00:47:12,413
Snake.

403
00:47:12,621 --> 00:47:17,251
Try Abdul Ben Hassan.
He make this snake!

404
00:48:18,979 --> 00:48:20,689
Abdul Hassan?

405
00:48:21,732 --> 00:48:25,152
I'm a police officer.
I'd like to ask you a few questions.

406
00:48:25,319 --> 00:48:28,364
Artificial-snake license XB71,
that's you?

407
00:48:29,365 --> 00:48:32,201
This is your work, huh?
Who did you sell it to?

408
00:48:32,368 --> 00:48:35,079
My work? Not too many
could afford such quality.

409
00:48:35,246 --> 00:48:36,372
How many?

410
00:48:36,539 --> 00:48:38,749
- Very few.
- How few?

411
00:48:38,958 --> 00:48:40,584
- Look, my friend--
- Taffey Lewis'.

412
00:48:40,751 --> 00:48:44,296
Down in Fourth Sector, Chinatown.

413
00:48:45,297 --> 00:48:49,593
<i>Cross now. Cross now. Cross now.</i>

414
00:48:49,760 --> 00:48:54,223
<i>Cross now. Cross now. Cross now.</i>

415
00:48:54,390 --> 00:48:57,476
<i>Cross now. Cross now.</i>

416
